    rewards = "Experience & Faction Reputation",
    tip = "$N, Melor Stonehoof has heard of your deeds, and has set a path before you.\n\nIf you wish to take it, then go to Thunder Bluff and speak with Melor.  You will find him on Hunter's Rise.",
