    rewards = "Experience & Faction Reputation",
    tip = "If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",
