    rewards = "6,600 XP, 1g 80s",
    tip = "By order of Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl, all dwarves on the field of battle are to be killed on sight.\n\nShould you slay a dwarf in combat, rip out their spine, leaving a spineless heap of stink and rot to serve as a warning to any and all that dare oppose the might of the Frostwolf.\n\nReturn to Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl with proof of your heroics.",
