    rewards = "6,600 XP, 1g 80s",
    tip = "By order of Corporal Noreg Stormpike, all able bodied soldiers of Stormpike are required to slay any opposing orcs that they meet upon the field of battle.\n\nSoldiers are required to remove a tusk or tooth from the maw of the enemy and present said tooth as proof of their accomplishment.\n\nWear protective gloves.",
