    rewards = "6,600 XP",
    tip = "A Wheel of the Black March contains and directs the violent energies required for the Circle of Greater Summoning.  For Gozeeki to construct a wheel, he will need both large brilliant shards from an enchanter, and dark iron ore from a master miner.\n\nAcquire these and bring them to my servant.",
