    ["steps"] = "1. Die in Blackrock Mountain and run as a ghost to the central tomb (54, 38) inside Forgewright's Tomb.\n2. Speak to Franclorn Forgewright (ghost) to accept 'Dark Iron Legacy'.\n3. Enter BRD, slay Fineous Darkvire to loot the Iron Fel.\n4. Carry Iron Fel past the Ring of Law to the Shrine of Thaurissan to forge your key.",
