    ["steps"] = "1. Speak to Commander Ashlam Valorfist (Alliance - Chillwind) or High Executor Derrington (Horde - Bulwark).\n2. Complete plague research quests across Western Plaguelands.\n3. Travel to Un'Goro Crater and forge the key in the lava pool at the summit of Fire Plume Ridge.\n4. Defeat Araj the Summoner in Andorhal (bring a 5-man group) to empower the key.",
