    ["steps"] = "1. Enter Dire Maul East (Warpwood wing).\n2. Speak to the imp Pusillin near the entrance; he taunts you and runs deeper into the dungeon.\n3. Chase him through the instance until he transforms into a hostile demon.\n4. Slay Pusillin and loot the Crescent Key.",
