    ["source"] = "Quest: 'Legends of Maraudon' inside Maraudon",
    ["steps"] = "1. Enter Maraudon Orange or Purple entrance.\n2. Slay Lord Vyletongue (Orange side) for Celebras' Diamond.\n3. Slay Noxxion (Purple side) for Celebras' Rod.\n4. Slay Celebras the Cursed, speak to his redeemed spirit, and watch him forge the Scepter.",
