    ["source"] = "Drop: Electrocutioner 6000 in Gnomeregan",
    ["steps"] = "1. Enter Gnomeregan from Dun Morogh or Booty Bay teleport.\n2. Navigate through the engineering cog halls and defeat Electrocutioner 6000.\n3. Loot the Workshop Key from his remains.",
    ["unlocks"] = "Unlocks the back workshop entrance gate located in western Dun Morogh, bypassing 80% of trash.",
