    ["dungeon"] = "Upper Blackrock Spire (UBRS)",
    ["source"] = "Quest: 'Seal of Ascension' from Vaelan inside Lower Blackrock Spire (LBRS)",
    ["steps"] = "1. Find Vaelan disguised on the hidden balcony above Halycon's lair in LBRS.\n2. Collect the **Unforged Seal of Ascension** (world drop in LBRS) and the 3 boss gemstones: **Gemstone of Spirestone** (Omokk), **Gemstone of Smolderthorn** (Voone), and **Gemstone of Bloodaxe** (Wyrmthalak).\n3. Travel to Emberstrife's Den in Dustwallow Marsh, weaken Emberstrife to 10% HP, Mind Control him to cast *Flame of the Black Dragonflight* on the Unforged Seal, and return to Vaelan.",
