    ["steps"] = "1. Travel to the **Altar of Zul** in central Hinterlands (level 48–50 elite troll pyramid).\n2. Slay Qiaga the Keeper and Morta'gya the Keeper at the top of the stairs to loot the **Sacred Mallet**.\n3. Carry the Sacred Mallet to the summit of **Jintha'Alor** (eastern Hinterlands elite city) and use it at the amphitheater altar (59, 79) to transform it into the **Mallet of Zul'Farrak**.",
    ["unlocks"] = "Rings the Gong inside Zul'Farrak to summon **Gahz'rilla** (required for the *Carrot on a Stick* +3% mount speed trinket quest!).",
