    ["leveling_brackets"] = "• **1–60 (Apprentice):** Minor Healing Potion, Lesser Armor Potion\n• **60–140 (Journeyman):** Healing Potion, Lesser Mana Potion, Fire Protection Potion\n• **140–210 (Expert):** Greater Healing Potion, Mana Potion, Elixir of Agility\n• **210–300 (Artisan):** Superior Healing Potion, Elixir of Greater Intellect, Major Healing Potion, Elixir of the Mongoose",
