    ["leveling_brackets"] = "• **1–50 (Apprentice):** Peacebloom & Silverleaf (Starter zones)\n• **50–125 (Journeyman):** Mageroyal, Briarthorn, Stranglekelp, Bruiseweed (Silverpine, Westfall, Barrens)\n• **125–200 (Expert):** Kingsblood, Fadeleaf, Goldthorn, Khadgar's Whisker (Arathi, STV, Swamp of Sorrows)\n• **200–300 (Artisan):** Firebloom, Sungrass, Blindweed, Dreamfoil, Plaguebloom, Black Lotus (Felwood, EPL, Winterspring)",
