    ["faction"] = "Horde",
    ["traits"] = "• **Will of the Forsaken (WotF):** Immune to Charm, Fear, and Sleep for 5s; breaks active Sleep/Charm/Fear (2-min CD; cannot be used under Scatter Shot)\n• **Touch of the Grave / Touch of the Dead (Forever Alpha):** **30% proc chance for casters** (20% for melee) on a 25s ICD; never breaks CC or triggers on non-damage spells\n• **Cannibalize:** Consumes a humanoid/undead corpse to regenerate 35% health over 10s (usable unless immune to Physical damage)\n• **Priest Racial — Dark Sacrifice:** Restores Mana scaling with Spirit without breaking damage-sensitive CC",
    ["meta"] = "Will of the Forsaken nullifies Fear/Sleep/Charm in PvP, while the tuned **Touch of the Grave / Dead** (25s ICD, CC-safe) provides consistent passive sustain and damage.",
    ["tip"] = "Touch of the Grave triggers on initial cast of Shadow Word: Pain, but never on periodic ticks or Distract/Polymorph.",
