    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **10 Bosses:** Lucifron, Magmadar, Gehennas, Garr, Baron Geddon, Shazzrah, Sulfuron Harbinger, Golemagg the Incinerator, Majordomo Executus, and **Ragnaros**.\n• **Dousing the 7 Runes:** Requires 7 **Aqual Quintessence** (Honored) or **Eternal Quintessence** (Revered with Hydraxian Waterlords) to summon Majordomo Executus.\n• **Trash Wipe Prevention:** Banish Lava Surgers (stop moving once Garr dies), pull Core Hound packs together (must die within 10s of each other or they self-resurrect!).",
    ["tip"] = "Bring Decursers (Mages/Druids), Dispel Magic (Priests/Paladins), 2+ Tranq Shot Hunters, and Greater Fire Protection Potions.",
  },
  ["lucifron"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Molten Core",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Impending Doom:** Inflicts 2,000 Shadow damage after 10 seconds to the raid. *Priests and Paladins must Dispel Magic immediately.*\n• **Lucifron's Curse:** Doubles the mana/rage/energy cost of all abilities for 5 minutes. *Mages and Druids must Remove Curse immediately.*\n• **Flamewaker Protectors (2 Adds):** Cast Dominate Mind (Mind Control). Off-tanks pull the 2 adds away from Lucifron and burn them down first.",
    ["tip"] = "Drop Tranquilizing Shot Tome from Lucifron on your first kill so your Hunters can dispel Magmadar's Frenzy next!",
