    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Frenzy:** Every 15–20s Magmadar enrages for +150% attack speed. *Hunters must establish a strict Tranquilizing Shot rotation!*\n• **Panic (AoE Fear):** Every 30s fears everyone within 30 yards. *Use Fear Ward, Tremor Totem, or Warrior Berserker Rage swaps.*\n• **Lava Bomb:** Spits burning magma pools on the ground. Ranged and healers must stay at max range (35+ yards) and sidestep fire patches.",
    ["tip"] = "The first killed Lucifron always drops Tome of Tranquilizing Shot — teach it to a Hunter immediately before pulling Magmadar.",
  },
  ["garr"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Molten Core",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **8 Firesworn Adds:** Warlocks Banish up to 4 Firesworns while Off-Tanks hold the remaining adds away from the raid.\n• **Eruption:** When a Firesworn dies or is forced to explode, it deals massive AoE knockback damage.\n• **Antimagic Pulse:** Garr strips 1 beneficial magic buff every 15s from nearby players.",
    ["tip"] = "Slaying Garr permanently stops Lava Surgers from respawning throughout Molten Core!",
  },
  ["baron geddon"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Molten Core",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Living Bomb:** Target ticks fire damage and explodes after 8s for 3200 damage to nearby players. *Run away from the raid immediately!* (Jump to avoid fall damage).\n• **Inferno:** Channels lethal point-blank fire AoE pulsing every second. *All melee must run out of melee range instantly!*\n• **Ignite Mana:** Drains 400 mana per tick and damages casters. *Priests and Shamans must Dispel / Purge immediately.*",
    ["tip"] = "Tank Baron in the central hallway of Garr's room to give players open space to run with Living Bomb.",
  },
  ["shazzrah"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Molten Core",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Arcane Explosion:** Lethal 20-yard point-blank Arcane AoE. *Keep all ranged/healers outside 25 yards; melee only go in with Greater Arcane Protection Potions.*\n• **Shazzrah's Curse:** Increases magic damage taken by 100%! *Mages and Druids must Decurse tanks and raid members instantly.*\n• **Blink (Gate of Shazzrah):** Teleports to a random player every 45s and wipes threat. Hunters pull him back to the Main Tank with Distracting Shot.",
    ["tip"] = "Priests and Shamans must instantly Dispel/Purge Shazzrah's *Deaden Magic* self-buff (-50% magic damage taken).",
