  ["majordomo executus"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Molten Core",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **8 Elite Guards:** 4 Flamewaker Healers and 4 Flamewaker Elites. Majordomo submits when all 8 adds are slain.\n• **Crowd Control:** Mages keep 4 Healers permanently Polymorphed while tanks hold the 4 Elites.\n• **Magic Reflection & Damage Shield:** Every 30s grants all adds either 50% Spell Reflect (STOP CASTING!) or 100 Fire thorns damage on melee hit.",
    ["tip"] = "Never speak to Majordomo in Ragnaros's lair until all 40 raiders are buffed and positioned around the lava spiral!",
  },
  ["ragnaros"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Molten Core",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Wrath of Ragnaros:** Knocks melee back and reduces threat. Main tanks swap immediately after each knockback.\n• **Submerge (Phase 2):** At 3 minutes, Ragnaros submerges and 8 Sons of Flame spawn. *Mages Frost Nova / AoE banish them down before Ragnaros returns.*\n• **Lava Spurt & Fire Protection:** Constant raid fire damage. *Every player must pre-pot Greater Fire Protection Potion before pull.*",
    ["tip"] = "High raid DPS can kill Ragnaros before the 3-minute submerge phase occurs ('Submerge Skip').",
  },
  ["onyxia"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Onyxia's Lair (40-Man Raid)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Phase 1 (Ground - 100% to 65%):** Tank Onyxia facing the north wall. Avoid **Flame Breath** (front cone) and **Tail Sweep** (knockback into whelp eggs!).\n• **Phase 2 (Air Phase - 65% to 40%):** Onyxia takes flight and casts **Fireballs** (reduce threat!) and lethal **Deep Breath** across the room. *Spread out and watch which cardinal direction she moves to dodge her diagonal breath path!*\n• **Phase 3 (Landing - 40% to 0%):** Casts **Bellowing Roar** (AoE Fear every 15–30s) while lava cracks erupt. Use Fear Ward / Tremor Totem / Berserker Rage.",
    ["tip"] = "Stop all DPS at 67% so the Main Tank builds a massive threat lead before Phase 3 landing!",
  },
  ["blackwing lair"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Blackwing Lair (BWL • 40-Man Raid)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **8 Bosses:** Razorgore the Untamed, Vaelastrasz the Corrupt, Broodlord Lashlayer, Firemaw, Ebonroc, Flamegor, Chromaggus, and **Nefarian**.\n• **Suppression Room:** Rogues must disarm Suppression Devices in lockstep while tanks chain-pull Hatchers and Whelps.\n• **Onyxia Scale Cloak:** Mandatory for Ebonroc, Flamegor, and Nefarian to prevent instant death from Shadow Flame.",
    ["tip"] = "Bring Restorative Potions and Hourglass Sand for Chromaggus, and Greater Fire Protection Potions for Vaelastrasz and Firemaw.",
  },
  ["razorgore"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Blackwing Lair",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Phase 1 (Orb of Domination):** Controller uses the Orb to mind-control Razorgore and destroy all **30 Dragon Eggs** around the room while the raid kites/kills spawning Dragonkin, Mages, and Legionnaires.\n• **Phase 2 (Boss Burn):** Once the 30th egg breaks, all remaining adds flee! Two tanks alternate on Razorgore to handle **Conflagration** (disorients current tank and drops aggro).",
    ["tip"] = "Hunters and Warriors can kite Phase 1 Dragonkin around the room in a circle using Piercing Howl so DPS only have to kill Mages!",
  },
  ["vaelastrasz"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Blackwing Lair",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Essence of the Red:** Grants infinite mana, 100 energy/s, and 50 rage/s for the entire fight. *All DPS go all-out!*\n• **Burning Adrenaline:** Targets a player every 15s. Increases damage by 100%, makes all spells instant-cast, but kills player after 20s. *Target must run to the wall away from raid before exploding!*\n• **Tank Chain:** Current tank dies when hit by Burning Adrenaline; next tank must instantly taunt and turn boss away from raid.",
    ["tip"] = "Known as 'The Guild Breaker'. Maximum DPS race; do not conserve cooldowns. Pre-cast Fire Protection Potions.",
  },
  ["broodlord lashlayer"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Blackwing Lair",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Mortal Strike:** Deals 4,500–6,500 physical damage and reduces healing on the Main Tank by 50% for 5s. *Pre-pot Greater Stoneshield Potion and Power Word: Shield the tank immediately!*\n• **Blast Wave:** Point-blank Fire AoE knockback that reduces threat by 50%.\n• **Knock Away:** Cuts current tank's threat in half; 2–3 tanks must build threat in the corner to catch him immediately.",
    ["tip"] = "Melees must wait for 3 Sunders and watch ThreatClassic2 carefully — pulling aggro turns Broodlord's Cleave onto the raid.",
  },
  ["firemaw"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Blackwing Lair",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Flame Buffet:** Stacks every 2.5s on anyone in Line-of-Sight (LoS) of Firemaw, increasing Fire damage taken by 150 per stack.\n• **LoS Corner Strategy:** DPS step out from behind the doorway pillar, deal damage until 4–6 stacks of Flame Buffet, then step back behind the wall for 20s to let stacks fall off.\n• **Wing Buffet (Every 30s):** Off-Tank taunts Firemaw 1 second before Wing Buffet so the Main Tank isn't knocked back and stripped of threat.",
    ["tip"] = "A Main Tank with 315 Fire Resistance (buffed) resists most Flame Buffet stacks and never has to swap!",
  },
  ["chromaggus"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Blackwing Lair",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Dual Breaths:** Every 30s Chromaggus casts 2 random breaths. *Time Lapse (hides behind ramp; drops tank threat); Ignite Flesh (burns); Frost Burn (burns mana).*\n• **Chromatic Afflictions:** 5 debuffs (Black, Blue, Bronze, Green, Red). *If any player reaches 5 stacks, they transform into an unstoppable mind-controlled Drakonid!* Priests/Restorative Potions dispel.\n• **Frenzy:** Periodically enrages for +200% attack speed. *Hunters must Tranq Shot immediately.*",
    ["tip"] = "Bring Hourglass Sand (drops in BWL trash) to cleanse the Bronze Affliction stun.",
  },
  ["nefarian"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Blackwing Lair",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Phase 1 (Drakonids):** Slay 42 color-coded Drakonids emerging from side doors before Nefarian lands.\n• **Phase 2 (Class Calls):** Nefarian corrupts specific classes every 30s:\n  - *Mages:* Polymorph entire raid (Priests dispel)\n  - *Priests:* Direct heals corrupt into lethal dots (stop healing!)\n  - *Hunters:* Weapons break instantly (swap to backup weapon!)\n  - *Druids:* Forced into Cat form\n  - *Rogues:* Teleported in front of boss\n• **Phase 3 (Undead Swarm):** At 20% HP, all dead Phase 1 Drakonids resurrect as Bone Constructs. *Mages AoE bomb down with Stratholme Holy Water.*",
    ["tip"] = "Every raider MUST wear the Onyxia Scale Cloak or Shadow Flame will instantly incinerate them for 20,000 damage.",
  },
  ["zul'gurub"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Zul'Gurub (ZG • 20-Man Raid)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **5 High Priests:** Jeklik (Bat), Venoxis (Snake), Mar'li (Spider), Thekal (Tiger), and Arlokk (Panther) must be defeated to strip **Hakkar the Soulflayer** of his 5 superpower abilities.\n• **Optional Bosses:** Bloodlord Mandokir (drops Swift Razzashi Raptor mount!), Jin'do the Hexxer, Gahz'ranka, and Edge of Madness.",
    ["tip"] = "Resets every 3 days! Turn in Heart of Hakkar on Yojamba Isle for the Zandalar Signet trinkets and Spirit of Zandalar world buff.",
  },
  ["hakkar"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Zul'Gurub",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Blood Siphon (Every 90s):** Hakkar drains health from all 20 players. If players are NOT poisoned, he heals for 1,000 HP per tick! If players ARE poisoned by **Corrupted Blood**, it deals damage to Hakkar instead!\n• **Son of Hakkar:** Slay a Son of Hakkar on the platform 15s before Blood Siphon and have the entire raid step into the green poison cloud.\n• **Cause Insanity:** Mind controls the #1 threat target every 20s. Mages Polymorph the MC'd Main Tank while the Off-Tank holds Hakkar.",
    ["tip"] = "Never dispel the green poison cloud debuff before Blood Siphon occurs, or Hakkar will heal back to full!",
  },
  ["ruins of ahn'qiraj"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj (AQ20 • 20-Man Raid)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **6 Bosses:** Kurinnaxx, General Rajaxx (7 waves), Moam, Buru the Gorger (egg kiting), Ayamiss the Hunter, and **Ossirian the Unscarred**.\n• **Class Skill Books:** Every boss drops high-rank Class Spell Books (Frostbolt XI, Fireball XII, Shadow Bolt X, Heroic Strike IX, Ferocious Bite V).",
    ["tip"] = "Resets every 3 days! Exalted Cenarion Circle + Revered Brood rewards powerful class weapon/ring/cloak sets.",
  },
  ["ossirian"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj (AQ20)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Strength of Ossirian:** Enters Supreme Mode (+300% damage, instant tank one-shot) unless weakened by clicking an **Anubisath Crystal** every 30s.\n• **Crystal Kite Route:** Assign 1 mounted player to scout ahead and click newly spawned Crystals while tanks kite Ossirian from crystal to crystal in a circle.\n• **Elemental Weakness:** Each crystal makes Ossirian take +100% damage from a specific magic school (Fire, Frost, Nature, Shadow, or Arcane) for 45s!",
    ["tip"] = "Click the First Crystal immediately on pull, and click the next Crystal when the current weakness timer has 5 seconds remaining.",
  },
  ["temple of ahn'qiraj"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Temple of Ahn'Qiraj (AQ40 • 40-Man Raid)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **9 Bosses:** The Prophet Skeram, Bug Trio (Kri/Yauj/Vem), Battleguard Sartura, Fankriss the Unyielding, Viscidus, Princess Huhuran, **Twin Emperors**, Ouro, and **C'Thun**.\n• **Resistance Gear:** 15 melee/rogue/warrior soakers need **200+ Nature Resistance** for Princess Huhuran, and 2 Warlock tanks need **250+ Shadow Resistance** for Twin Emperors.",
    ["tip"] = "Bring Frost Wands / Frost Oil for Viscidus and Greater Nature Protection Potions for Huhuran and C'Thun.",
  },
  ["prophet skeram"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Temple of Ahn'Qiraj (AQ40)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **True Fulfillment (Mind Control):** Mind-controls a player with +300% damage and instant casts. *Mages must Polymorph MC'd raiders immediately!*\n• **Arcane Explosion:** Casts 1.0s Arcane Explosion whenever melee attack him. *Rogues and Warriors must maintain a strict Kick / Pummel / Earth Shock interrupt chain!*\n• **Split Images (75%, 50%, 25% HP):** Splits into 3 copies; the 2 illusions have low HP and must be identified and killed first.",
    ["tip"] = "Pre-pop a Greater Arcane Protection Potion before pull to absorb stray Arcane Explosions during image splits.",
  },
  ["princess huhuran"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Temple of Ahn'Qiraj (AQ40)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Berserk at 30% HP:** At 30% health, Huhuran fires lethal **Poison Bolts** hitting the 15 closest players for 2,000 Nature damage every 2 seconds!\n• **15 Nature Resist Soakers:** The 15 closest players (Tanks, Rogues, Warriors, Hunters pets) must wear **200+ Nature Resistance** to soak the Poison Volley while ranged/healers stand outside.\n• **Wyvern Sting:** Puts 10 players to sleep; if dispelled early, it deals 3,000 Nature damage.",
    ["tip"] = "Save all offensive cooldowns (Death Wish, Recklessness, Blade Flurry, Bloodlust/Juju) for 31% HP to burn her from 30% to 0% in under 15 seconds!",
  },
  ["twin emperors"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Temple of Ahn'Qiraj (AQ40)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Shared Health & Heal:** **Emperor Vek'lor** (immune to physical, weak to magic) and **Emperor Vek'nilash** (immune to magic, weak to physical) heal each other if brought within 60 yards!\n• **Warlock Tanking:** Two Warlocks in **250+ Shadow Resistance** tank Vek'lor using *Searing Pain* on the left stairs, while two Warriors tank Vek'nilash on the right stairs.\n• **Teleport Swap (Every 30–40s):** The Emperors swap positions and wipe threat! Tanks must stop attacking 2s before teleport, then immediately establish aggro on the new Emperor.",
    ["tip"] = "Wait 2 full seconds after each Teleport before DPS attack, so the Warlock (Searing Pain) and Warrior (Bloodthirst/Shield Slam) lock in initial threat!",
  },
  ["c'thun"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Temple of Ahn'Qiraj (AQ40)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Eye Beam (Phase 1):** Bounces between players closer than 10 yards, doubling damage with each jump (instantly wipes raid). *Maintain strict 10-yard spread around the entire room at all times!*\n• **Dark Glare:** Rotates a lethal red laser beam around the room. *Run around the room clockwise/counter-clockwise to stay ahead of the beam.*\n• **Phase 2 (Stomach Team):** C'Thun swallows players into his stomach. Slay the 2 Flesh Tentacles inside to weaken C'Thun's shield for a 45-second vulnerable burn phase.",
    ["tip"] = "Positioning is 90% of this fight. Use range-check addons set to 10 yards before entering the threshold.",
  },
  ["naxxramas"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Naxxramas (The Dread Citadel • 40-Man Raid)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **5 Wings (15 Bosses):**\n  - **Arachnid Quarter:** Anub'Rekhan, Grand Widow Faerlina, Maexxna\n  - **Plague Quarter:** Noth the Plaguebringer, Heigan the Unclean, Loatheb\n  - **Military Quarter:** Instructor Razuvious, Gothik the Harvester, The Four Horsemen\n  - **Construct Quarter:** Patchwerk, Grobbulus, Gluth, Thaddius\n  - **Frostwyrm Lair:** Sapphiron (requires 200+ Frost Resist across raid) & **Kel'Thuzad**",
    ["tip"] = "Drops Tier 3 sets, Atiesh splinters, The Hungering Cold, and Gressil, Dawn of Ruin.",
  },
  ["anub'rekhan"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Naxxramas (Arachnid Quarter)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Locust Swarm (Every 85–95s):** Anub'Rekhan slows to 60% speed and emits a lethal 30-yard silence/dot aura. *Main Tank must kite him in a wide circle around the outer perimeter with Aspect of the Pack!*\n• **Impale:** Launches a line of spikes at a random player, knocking everyone in its path into the air for fall damage.\n• **Crypt Guard Adds:** Spawn corpses scarabs when killed; cleave down Crypt Guards before Locust Swarm begins.",
    ["tip"] = "A Hunter runs ahead of the Main Tank with Aspect of the Pack active during Locust Swarm so the tank outruns the boss.",
  },
  ["patchwerk"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Naxxramas (Construct Quarter)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Hateful Strike:** Every 1.2s strikes the player with the highest HP within melee range (excluding the primary tank) for 5000–8000 physical damage.\n• **Soak Tanks:** 2-3 Off-Tanks with massive HP pools (buffed to 10,000+ HP with Titans Flasks) take continuous Hateful Strikes; dedicated healers assigned to spam each OT.\n• **Berserk Enrage:** At 7 minutes or 5% HP, attacks 100% faster and wipes the raid.",
    ["tip"] = "Melee DPS must dip their feet into the green slime water before the pull to ensure their HP is lower than the Off-Tanks.",
  },
  ["loatheb"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Naxxramas (Plague Quarter)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Corrupted Mind:** Every healing spell gains a **60-second cooldown**! Assign a strict numbered healer rotation (Healer 1->2->3..->12) to heal the Main Tank every 5 seconds.\n• **Fungal Spores:** Spawn every 12s; 5 players step into the Spore to burst it for **+50% Critical Strike Chance** and **zero threat generated** for 90s!\n• **Inevitable Doom:** Ticks for 2,550 Shadow damage across the entire raid every 30s (then every 15s after 5 minutes). *Rotate Greater Shadow Protection Potions and Healthstones/Bandages!*",
    ["tip"] = "With the Spore buff (+50% Crit & 0% threat), DPS can go 100% all-out without ever pulling aggro!",
  },
  ["thaddius"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Naxxramas (Construct Quarter)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Phase 1 (Feugen & Stalagg):** Must be killed on their side platforms **within 5 seconds of each other** or they resurrect! Then jump the gap onto Thaddius's ledge.\n• **Polarity Shift (Every 30s):** Assigns every raider either **Positive (+)** or **Negative (-)** charge. *Stand with matching charges (+10% damage per stack up to +200%!); standing near opposite charges zaps the raid to death!*\n• **Standard Positioning:** Negative (-) stands on the **Left**, Positive (+) stands on the **Right**. Run counter-clockwise through the boss when your charge flips.",
    ["tip"] = "Wait 3 seconds after Polarity Shift finishes casting before moving so you don't shock players mid-transition.",
  },
  ["four horsemen"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Naxxramas (Military Quarter)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **4 Corner Marks:** Thane Korth'azz (Meteor), Lady Blaumeux (Void Zone), Sir Zeliek (Holy Wrath chain), and Highlord Mograine (Righteous Fire).\n• **Stacking Marks:** Every 12s each Horseman applies a Mark within 65 yards (Mark 1: 0 dmg, Mark 2: 250, Mark 3: 1000, Mark 4: 3000 = death!).\n• **Tank & Healer Rotation:** Tanks and healers must rotate out of corners at **3 Marks**; burn Thane Korth'azz first in the south-west corner.",
    ["tip"] = "Requires 8 Warriors in 4pc Tier 3 (Dreadnaught +5% Taunt hit bonus) or Nat Pagle's Broken Reel trinket so Taunt transitions never resist!",
  },
  ["sapphiron"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Naxxramas (Frostwyrm Lair)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Frost Aura:** Ticks 600 Frost damage every 2 seconds to all 40 players for the entire fight. *Every raider needs 180–220 Frost Resistance gear!*\n• **Life Drain:** Drains 2,000 HP every 3s from 5 players and heals Sapphiron for 5x the amount! *Mages and Druids MUST Decurse Life Drain within 1 second!*\n• **Air Phase & Frost Breath:** Freezes 2 players into Ice Blocks, then drops a nuclear Frost Bomb. *The entire raid must hide directly behind one of the Ice Block players for Line-of-Sight!*",
    ["tip"] = "Drops the legendary Sapphiron Shoulder Enchants (Might of the Scourge, Power of the Scourge, Resilience of the Scourge)!",
  },
  ["kel'thuzad"] = {
    ["raid"] = "Naxxramas (Frostwyrm Lair)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Phase 1 (5-Minute Wave Defense):** Slay Soldiers of the Frozen Wastes (ranged instant kill), Unstoppable Abominations (melee cleave), and Soul Weavers (wail knockback).\n• **Phase 2 (Kel'Thuzad):**\n  - **Frostbolt (Single Target):** Lethal 10,000 dmg cast on tank. *Rogues and Warriors must interrupt 100% of single-target Frostbolts!*\n  - **Frost Blast:** Encases target + anyone within 10 yards in ice dealing 104% max HP over 4s! *Healers must land a heal inside the 4-second window or targets die; maintain 10-yard spread!*\n  - **Shadow Fissure & Detonate Mana:** Sidestep red void zones instantly; casters move away when marked with Detonate Mana.\n• **Phase 3 (40% HP):** 5 Guardians of Icecrown spawn. Priests Shackle 3 Guardians while Off-Tanks hold the remaining 2.",
    ["tip"] = "Never break Shackle Undead in Phase 3 — if a 4th Guardian is shackled, all 3 existing shackles shatter simultaneously!",
  },
  ["temporal rift"] = {
    ["raid"] = "The Temporal Rift (WoW Forever 20-Man)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Chronomantic Fissures:** Portals spawn alternate timeline echoes. Tanks must pull temporal anomalies into collapsing rift zones.\n• **Time Shift Paradox:** Boss reverses raid positioning by 10 seconds. Keep mental track of safe ground.\n• **Murozond Echo:** Sandstorm breath requires line-of-sight behind chronosteel pillars.",
    ["tip"] = "Flagship 20-man raid in the alternate Dark Portal timeline; drops the 'Signet of the Unopened Portal' horizontal progression tier.",
  },
  ["verdant scar"] = {
    ["raid"] = "The Verdant Scar (Mount Hyjal - WoW Forever)",
    ["level"] = 63,
    ["key_mechanics"] = "• **Nightmare Brambles:** Root players and pulse shadow nature damage. Cleansed by Druids and Shamans.\n• **Corrupted Remulos:** Phases between Cenarion Wrath (Arcane firestorms) and Defiled Tranquility (requires physical interrupts).\n• **Archimonde Remnant:** Avoid doomfire trails along the roots of World Tree Nordrassil.",
    ["tip"] = "Requires Mount Hyjal attunement via Cenarion Circle rep and Roots of Nordrassil dungeon run.",
  },
}

